    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"memo\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4dd\" role=\"img\" title=\"memo\">:memo:</span> fitzgen submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14797#pullrequestreview-5618475937\">PR review</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Some feedback on the code itself.</p>\n<p>Thanks again!</p>\n</blockquote>",
